{
  "version": "4.0.0",
  "language": "fr",
  "language_raw": "French",
  "source": "message/dat/French/script/sdc02_0080.dat",
  "paired_tbl": "message/dat/French/script/sdc02_0080.tbl",
  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_01",
      "hash64": "EE58D31F07F68497",
      "text": "Alors, tu as réussi à capturer un Pokémon\\nsous sa Forme d’Alola ?",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_02",
      "hash64": "EE58D41F07F6864A",
      "text": "Continue de chercher, tu vas finir par trouver !\\n« Tranquiiille » comme on dit parfois à Alola !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_03",
      "hash64": "EE58D51F07F687FD",
      "text": "Je regrette de te l’annoncer, mais ce n’est pas\\nune Forme d’Alola.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_04",
      "hash64": "EE58CE1F07F67C18",
      "text": "Oh ! C’est un [VAR 0x0101(0001)] dans sa Forme\\nd’Alola, cela ne fait aucun doute !",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0101",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_05",
      "hash64": "EE58CF1F07F67DCB",
      "text": "On surnomme ce Pokémon « le surfeur\\ntellurique » !\\c\\nIl concentre son énergie psychique dans sa queue\\net s’en sert comme d’une planche de surf !",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_06",
      "hash64": "EE58D01F07F67F7E",
      "text": "Il communique avec ses congénères en faisant\\nosciller doucement les vibrisses métalliques\\r\\nqui poussent sur sa tête !",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_07",
      "hash64": "EE58D11F07F68131",
      "text": "Les vibrisses dorées de ce Pokémon sont des\\ncapteurs très puissants.\\c\\nElles lui permettent de repérer le moindre bruit\\nà plusieurs kilomètres !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_08",
      "hash64": "EE58CA1F07F6754C",
      "text": "En voilà un Pokémon capricieux, nombriliste\\net inconstant !\\c\\nCela dit, il est très populaire auprès des gens\\naltruistes qui aiment les défis.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_09",
      "hash64": "EE58CB1F07F676FF",
      "text": "Ce Pokémon est incroyablement agile !\\c\\nIl est très populaire à Alola grâce à son\\nvisage rond et son pelage très doux !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_10",
      "hash64": "EE5C581F07F99C6D",
      "text": "Les Tadmorv ont été introduits pour régler\\nle problème des ordures à Alola.\\c\\nPersonne ne sait pourquoi, mais ils ont\\nsoudainement pris cette apparence !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_11",
      "hash64": "EE5C571F07F99ABA",
      "text": "Les « crocs » et les « griffes » de ce Pokémon\\nsont des toxines cristallisées.\\c\\nElles empoisonnent tout ce qu’elles touchent !\\nMieux vaut rester à distance...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_12",
      "hash64": "EE5C561F07F99907",
      "text": "Au fil de sa croissance, les pouvoirs psychiques\\nde ce Pokémon sont devenus inutiles.\\c\\nPendant ce temps, le pouvoir des dragons qui\\nsommeillait en lui s’est réveillé !",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_13",
      "hash64": "EE5C551F07F99754",
      "text": "La température du souffle de ce Pokémon\\ndescend à -50 °C !\\c\\nCertains l’appellent encore parfois par\\nson ancien nom : « Ke’oke’o ».",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 58,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_14",
      "hash64": "EE5C541F07F995A1",
      "text": "Ce Pokémon vit dans les montagnes enneigées\\net sa fourrure peut générer des boules de glace.\\c\\nJadis, il était adoré comme un avatar divin !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_15",
      "hash64": "EE5C531F07F993EE",
      "text": "À force de vivre sur les sommets enneigés,\\nce Pokémon a développé un dos de glace dur\\r\\ncomme l’acier, mais son ventre est resté mou !",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_16",
      "hash64": "EE5C521F07F9923B",
      "text": "Ce Pokémon peut sillonner les étendues\\nenneigées à toute allure !\\c\\nPour s’assurer une meilleure prise sur la glace,\\nil a développé des griffes épaisses et pointues.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_17",
      "hash64": "EE5C511F07F99088",
      "text": "Ce Pokémon est composé de roche magnétique !\\nDe la poussière métallique recouvre les parties\\r\\nles plus magnétiques de son corps !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_18",
      "hash64": "EE5C501F07F98ED5",
      "text": "Ce Pokémon a un tempérament belliqueux !\\nSon corps est chargé en électricité grâce aux\\r\\npierres dont il raffole !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_19",
      "hash64": "EE5C4F1F07F98D22",
      "text": "Ce Pokémon est buté et caractériel !\\nQuand il s’énerve, il produit des décharges et\\r\\nses cris évoquent les roulements du tonnerre !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_fairybb_01",
      "hash64": "CE97A87B27A6F75A",
      "text": "Hein ?! Tu as déjà capturé un Pokémon sous\\nsa Forme d’Alola ?![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 62,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_select_01",
      "hash64": "49B42BEA169DA8EB",
      "text": "J’ai tout donné !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_select_02",
      "hash64": "49B42CEA169DAA9E",
      "text": "C’était simple comme tout !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_fairybb_02",
      "hash64": "CE97A77B27A6F5A7",
      "text": "Tes talents ne se limitent donc pas au combat,\\nils s’étendent aussi à la capture de Pokémon ![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_fairybb_03",
      "hash64": "CE97A67B27A6F3F4",
      "text": "Les enseignements de l’Académie Orange\\ndoivent être d’un très haut niveau ![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_fairybb_04",
      "hash64": "CE97A57B27A6F241",
      "text": "Les enseignements de l’Académie Raisin\\ndoivent être d’un très haut niveau ![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_20",
      "hash64": "EE5FBE1F07FC7F96",
      "text": "Très bien ! Poursuivons, si vous le voulez bien !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_21",
      "hash64": "EE5FBF1F07FC8149",
      "text": "L’heure de la fin du cours a sonné !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_22",
      "hash64": "EE5FBC1F07FC7C30",
      "text": "Si vous n’avez pas encore attrapé de Pokémon,\\nvous devrez terminer cet exercice pour\\r\\nle prochain cours !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_mob_01",
      "hash64": "9A95444F99F3B847",
      "text": "Pfff, encore du travail en plus...\\nLe seum...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_fairybb_05",
      "hash64": "CE97A47B27A6F08E",
      "text": "Alors, qu’as-tu pensé de ton premier cours\\nà l’Institut Myrtille, [VAR 0x0100(0000)] ?[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_select_03",
      "hash64": "49B42DEA169DAC51",
      "text": "C’était génial !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_select_04",
      "hash64": "49B42EEA169DAE04",
      "text": "C’était facile !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_fairybb_06",
      "hash64": "CE97A37B27A6EEDB",
      "text": "Oh, ça me fait très plaisir de l’entendre ![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_fairybb_07",
      "hash64": "CE97A27B27A6ED28",
      "text": "Vraiment ? Les cours de ton académie doivent\\nêtre bien difficiles, alors ![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_fairybb_08",
      "hash64": "CE97A17B27A6EB75",
      "text": "Ah ! Il est déjà l’heure d’aller à mon club ![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 45,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_fairybb_09",
      "hash64": "CE97A07B27A6E9C2",
      "text": "C’est la fin de cette visite guidée, mais avant\\nque nous nous séparions, il me reste un dernier\\r\\nsujet à aborder ![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 116,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_fairybb_10",
      "hash64": "CE94237B27A3DF84",
      "text": "Il s’agit des [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]activités extracurriculaires[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]\\n[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]de l’Institut Myrtille[VAR 0xFF00(0000)], ou « [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]activités Myrtille [VAR 0xFF00(0000)]» ![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
